1
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,680
Commanders,

2
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,320
I hope everyone will follow the observation rules.

3
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:39,520
We have just intercepted

4
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:41,520
an attempt using a mobile phone message

5
00:01:41,720 --> 00:01:42,920
to tip off the ammo depot.

6
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:44,800
To tell you the truth,

7
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:47,800
although we haven't jammed the signals,

8
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:50,920
regarding directional information transmission,

9
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:52,120
we have taken measures.

10
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,200
Therefore,

11
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:54,920
please do not make any more futile efforts.

12
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,840
This kid... really knows his stuff.

13
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:00,240
I told you earlier.

14
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:02,920
Don't waste your effort, but you wouldn't listen.

15
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,200
How is the signal?

16
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:12,680
Staff Officer Liang, target is clear.

17
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:13,960
Currently, the Electronic Warfare Brigade

18
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,240
is conducting a small-scale combat drill.

19
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:16,720
Keep tracking.

20
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:17,480
Yes, sir.

21
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:19,920
Execute.

22
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:20,880
Yes, sir.

23
00:02:21,760 --> 00:02:23,920
Initiating intrusion into the target system.

24
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:25,560
Our electronic warfare detachment's

25
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,120
target unit for this operation

26
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:29,120
is the group army's Electronic Warfare Brigade.

27
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:30,560
The objective of this operation

28
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:33,320
is a combat drill they are organizing.

29
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,520
Our exercise objective

30
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:37,360
is to hack into their live drill frequency,

31
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,080
and then,

32
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:39,360
in the capacity of a referee,

33
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:40,680
announce the results.

34
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:48,760
Report!

35
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,160
The jamming detachment

36
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:52,080
has successfully breached the Electronic Warfare Brigade's

37
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,840
two drilling detachments.

38
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:56,360
Copy that. Prepare to return to base.

39
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:57,080
Yes, sir.

40
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,920
Hacking into the long-range fire strike system.

41
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:02,040
The connection between the long-range fire system

42
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:03,880
and our command system

43
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,600
was primarily established by our

44
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:07,000
trainees in the intensive training.

45
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:09,680
We have already reported to the commanders

46
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,360
of the artillery unit.

47
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:12,360
We will only demonstrate the process,

48
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:14,240
but I can assure everyone that

49
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,240
if necessary,

50
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:17,120
we can execute a target strike at any time.

51
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:25,880
Guo Zijian!

52
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:27,200
Sir!

53
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:28,720
We have an impromptu mission

54
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:29,800
for you to execute immediately.

55
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:30,280
Yes, sir!

56
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:42,880
How about it?

57
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,160
Any difficulties?

58
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,280
Of course there are.

59
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,920
Our Special Ops unit is not in the designated area.

60
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:51,160
Then have them hurry to the designated area.

61
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:54,120
We can't just watch your pre-arranged drills.

62
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:54,840
Yes, sir.

63
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:56,240
I'll issue the order immediately.

64
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:57,880
Switch to the Special Ops unit.

65
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:58,480
Yes, sir.

66
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,760
Special Ops unit.

67
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,680
Sir!

68
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:04,840
There's a change in the mission.

69
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:06,600
The specific mission details

70
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,880
will be sent to you shortly via encrypted message.

71
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:10,320
Upon receiving the order,

72
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:11,520
commence action immediately.

73
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:12,120
Yes, sir.

74
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:14,520
Drone unit.

75
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:15,400
Sir!

76
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:17,240
Fully cooperate with the Special Ops unit.

77
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,360
Commence action.

78
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:18,800
Yes, sir.

79
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:22,440
I wonder what this impromptu mission is.

80
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,520
The commanders are all here today.

81
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,880
Guo Zijian better not drop the ball.

82
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:29,520
He'd better not embarrass our 396th Brigade.

83
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:42,040
Aircraft 1.

84
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:44,240
Immediately conduct an electronic sweep of the assigned area

85
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,680
and quickly lock onto the target.

86
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:48,280
Simultaneously send coordinates to the Special Ops team.

87
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:49,680
Aircraft 2.

88
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:51,080
Continue executing your original mission.

89
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:52,280
Roger.

90
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,760
This is totally insane.

91
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,840
It is insane,

92
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,240
but it's also an order.

93
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:24,440
Based on the provided phone location,

94
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,560
the target is locked.

95
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:27,320
Special ops team, coordinates sent.

96
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:28,200
Acknowledge, over.

97
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:29,360
Honey Badger copies.

98
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,240
Drones will continue tracking.

99
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:33,120
Once the helicopter arrives,

100
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,760
drones will destroy the front and rear vehicles,

101
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:36,080
and the helicopter will carry out the rescue.

102
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:36,840
Copy that.

103
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:38,960
That kid Guo Zijian

104
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,880
really stole the spotlight.

105
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:45,160
I figured this would be included,

106
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:46,600
but I never expected

107
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:49,960
Guo Zijian to actually go after the existing units.

108
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:53,440
The commander chose him for the graduation report.

109
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:55,240
I concede.

110
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:59,720
You're conceding just like that?

111
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:00,680
Let me tell you,

112
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,760
this kid is too ruthless.

113
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,120
He embarrasses people at every turn.

114
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,040
Don't you worry.

115
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:07,760
He won't be cocky for much longer.

116
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,520
Descend, descend.

117
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,320
Descend, descend.

118
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:24,160
Salute!

119
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:29,960
Commander Jiang.

120
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:35,880
Didn't expect this, did you?

121
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:42,280
A commander of such high rank

122
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:44,360
personally acting as a hostage.

123
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:48,200
This is already common around the world.

124
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:49,640
Our senior commanders

125
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:51,120
also possess the same courage.

126
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:53,600
As our troops' combat-oriented training

127
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,560
continues to improve,

128
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:57,120
senior commanders heading to the front lines

129
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,920
will definitely become more common.

130
00:08:14,320 --> 00:08:14,880
Report.

131
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:16,560
Unit Two has entered the strike zone.

132
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:17,840
Hold steady.

133
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:18,720
Stand by for orders.

134
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:19,760
Copy that.

135
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:30,400
Good work, comrades.

136
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,360
Do you all feel

137
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,000
I took a risk today?

138
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,520
Let me tell you,

139
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,240
this is nothing.

140
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,120
You might not know this,

141
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:42,440
but when I was young,

142
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,440
in the army skills competition,

143
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,960
I won first place too.

144
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:55,400
Guo Zijian!

145
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:56,720
Sir!

146
00:08:57,040 --> 00:08:59,080
Your drones performed well just now.

147
00:08:59,160 --> 00:09:01,000
They took out the vehicles in front of and behind me.

148
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:02,560
However,

149
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,080
this is just a demonstration.

150
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:05,960
If this were real combat,

151
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,920
at such a speed,

152
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,840
could you still take them out?

153
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:11,160
Sir,

154
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,400
