155
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:14,440
Please take a seat.

156
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:15,280
Alright.

157
00:09:20,920 --> 00:09:21,720
Beihua,

158
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,320
