159
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,080
Sit down.

160
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:31,080
Drone live-fire strike on moving targets.

161
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:31,640
Begin.

162
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:32,240
Yes, sir.

163
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:44,120
All these days of training

164
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,200
were just for this moment.

165
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:46,840
Let's see where you run.

166
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,360
I really didn't expect

167
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:08,160
Commander Jiang to come all this way

168
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:10,240
to personally support Guo Zijian.

169
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:11,560
What are you talking about?

170
00:10:12,160 --> 00:10:14,440
The Commander isn't supporting Guo Zijian,

171
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:17,320
he's supporting New Quality Combat Capability.

172
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,000
Moving forward,

173
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,320
whoever seizes

174
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,920
the core of New Quality Combat Capability

175
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:23,680
will stay ahead of the game.

176
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:25,600
It's a pity

177
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:27,160
that person isn't you.

178
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:29,560
It's about timing...

179
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:30,560
and destiny.

180
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,280
Stop being so sentimental.

181
00:10:33,040 --> 00:10:34,160
I have only myself to blame.

182
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:36,040
I didn't put enough effort

183
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:38,520
into New Quality Combat Capability from the start.

184
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:41,240
You think I'm feeling sorry for you?

185
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,080
Have some shame, will you?

186
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:46,440
What do you mean?

187
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,440
Do I have to spell it out for you?

188
00:10:53,680 --> 00:10:55,760
Do you think you did right by Deputy Brigade Commander Suo?

189
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,160
Yes.

190
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:01,560
I did let him down.

191
00:11:01,880 --> 00:11:03,160
That's not what I'm talking about.

192
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:07,520
Think about it.

193
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:10,400
If the one presenting the demonstration

194
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:12,840
on stage right now was you, Jiang Shengqiang,

195
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:14,400
then in a few days,

196
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:16,560
the position of our brigade commander

197
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:18,160
would basically be locked in

198
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:19,120
for Deputy Brigade Commander Suo, right?

199
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:23,680
But now that person has changed to Guo Zijian,

200
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:26,560
which brings a lot of uncertainty.

201
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:28,600
Wait.

202
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,520
Isn't Brigade Commander Yang getting transferred?

203
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,360
Then Deputy Brigade Commander Suo's promotion

204
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,560
should be a matter of course, shouldn't it?

205
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:36,440
Didn't you just say it yourself?

206
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:38,760
Whoever seizes the core of New Quality Combat Capability

207
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:40,680
takes a huge lead.

208
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,040
Think about it.

209
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:45,200
If you were the one who seized it,

210
00:11:45,640 --> 00:11:47,040
then the one who has been mentoring you,

211
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:49,600
and will continue to mentor you in the future...

212
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,240
Who would that be?

213
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:56,920
I initially thought

214
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:58,960
Guo Zijian had other issues

215
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,880
that would affect his control over the training team.

216
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,160
But I didn't expect

217
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:04,480
Commander Jiang to personally come and oversee things.

218
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:06,560
How is this going to

219
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:08,360
play out from now on?

220
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:12,160
All right.

221
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:13,240
It's time.

222
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,720
We should head back for the meeting.

223
00:12:18,920 --> 00:12:19,720
Comrades.

224
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:21,760
To tell you the truth,

225
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:23,840
I am truly amazed

226
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:25,240
at how fast our country's

227
00:12:25,520 --> 00:12:27,240
technology has developed.

228
00:12:27,800 --> 00:12:28,840
While on the move,

229
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:30,600
I was able to use wireless transmission

230
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:34,000
to watch the training team's demonstration.

231
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:36,560
As soon as my phone number was provided,

232
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:39,920
the vehicle was quickly locked onto via satellite.

233
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,120
And the signal was

234
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:43,240
swiftly redirected to

235
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:44,720
the drones and helicopters.

236
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:48,120
My convoy was traveling at such a high speed,

237
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:51,800
yet the drones precisely targeted the front and rear vehicles,

238
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:54,240
and via the helicopters

239
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:56,360
and our special operations elite,

240
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:58,080
they forced the vehicles to a halt.

241
00:12:58,680 --> 00:13:00,600
This is the power of advanced technology.

242
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:03,360
The surprises today

243
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:05,000
are far more than just this.

244
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:06,200
The reconnaissance detachment

245
00:13:06,560 --> 00:13:07,960
managed to conduct recon on the ammo depot

246
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:10,840
in broad daylight.

247
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:12,680
The electronic warfare detachment

248
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:15,320
actually chose the Electronic Warfare Brigade's

249
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:17,360
drill site to make their move.

250
00:13:18,280 --> 00:13:20,280
Then there was the coordination with long-range rocket artillery,

251
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:22,640
and the precision of the aerial assault.

252
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:23,920
It wasn't long,

253
00:13:24,280 --> 00:13:25,240
but the content

254
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:27,520
and the depth of the subjects covered

255
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:30,200
compared to a large-scale exercise we'd organize,

256
00:13:30,280 --> 00:13:31,320
were even more enriching

257
00:13:31,680 --> 00:13:32,680
and more brilliant.

258
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,160
So I say,

259
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:37,320
the synthesis of New Quality Combat Capability

260
00:13:37,680 --> 00:13:38,680
should be prioritized,

261
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:39,720
and moreover,

262
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:40,920
it must be prioritized.

263
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:49,360
Of course.

264
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,800
Today's demonstration took advantage of

265
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:54,640
the peacetime complacency in many of our units.

266
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:57,200
In a real wartime scenario,

267
00:13:57,600 --> 00:14:00,040
perhaps none of it would have succeeded.

268
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:00,760
But,

269
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:02,920
their approach to the demonstration

270
00:14:03,040 --> 00:14:04,640
and their scope of thinking

271
00:14:04,920 --> 00:14:07,320
go far beyond our conventional mindset.

272
00:14:07,880 --> 00:14:09,200
For this alone,

273
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:11,320
I, Jiang Anmin, am truly impressed.

274
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:13,560
Alright.

275
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:15,480
That's all I have to say.

276
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:18,480
Up next is your group army's

277
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:22,040
naming ceremony for the Wind Rider and Hurricane Battalions.

278
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:24,320
I won't overstep my bounds.

279
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:26,000
Thank you, comrades.

280
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:40,040
In accordance with the Army

281
00:14:40,640 --> 00:14:42,480
and Theater Command's unified deployment,

282
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:43,600
I hereby announce

283
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:46,560
the Chinese People's Liberation Army

284
00:14:46,920 --> 00:14:48,200
8th Group Army's order:

285
00:14:48,520 --> 00:14:49,280
Stand up!

286
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:51,440
Effective immediately,

287
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,840
the 1st Combined Arms Battalion of the 396th Brigade is granted

288
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:55,760
the codename Wind Rider Battalion.

289
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,080
The position of Battalion Commander

290
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:59,800
will be assumed by Comrade Guo Zijian.

291
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:21,680
As you all know,

292
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:23,480
a while ago,

293
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:24,760
we organized the

294
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:26,640
New Quality Combat Forces Competition,

295
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:27,960
and it drew a lot of attention.

296
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:30,160
It even brought in the HQ's special ops team.

297
00:15:31,560 --> 00:15:32,320
Some have said,

298
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:34,320
now that the competition is over

299
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:36,160
and the champion has been chosen,

300
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,040
we should make an official announcement.

301
00:15:39,920 --> 00:15:41,240
After deliberation, the army group

302
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:42,800
has decided to do just that.

303
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,320
As the champion

304
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:46,800
is from the 396th Brigade's 2nd Combined Arms Battalion,

305
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:48,720
we have decided

306
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:50,600
to grant the 396th Brigade's 2nd Combined Arms Battalion

307
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:51,960
the designation

308
00:15:52,760 --> 00:15:54,200
of "Hurricane Battalion."

309
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:56,520
I now announce

310
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:57,920
that the Battalion Commander

311
00:15:58,640 --> 00:16:00,360
will be Comrade Jiang Shengqiang.

312
00:16:25,400 --> 00:16:27,160
Comrades, as you've all seen,

313
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:30,240
the code names for Combined Arms Battalions One and Two

314
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:32,400
both contain the word "wind."

315
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:34,040
Why is that?

316
00:16:34,680 --> 00:16:35,600
It's because

317
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:37,080
they are

318
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:38,840
riding the easterly wind of

319
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:40,880
the Chinese military's reform and development,

320
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:43,240
carrying the Chinese Army's

321
00:16:43,520 --> 00:16:45,360
invincible mighty wind.

322
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:47,680
In the history of the People's Army,

323
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:50,240
there have emerged

324
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:51,880
the Red Dagger Company

325
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:53,640
and the Hardbone Sixth Company,

326
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:55,680
such outstanding grassroots units.

327
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:57,360
The commanders gave you these two

328
00:16:57,360 --> 00:16:58,480
resounding names,

329
00:16:58,800 --> 00:17:00,120
hoping that you

330
00:17:00,120 --> 00:17:02,480
will become new benchmarks on the road ahead.

331
00:17:03,280 --> 00:17:03,760
Comrades!

332
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:06,200
The great wind rises!

333
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:08,880
May our Wind Rider Battalion and Hurricane Battalion

334
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,000
achieve victory from the start,

335
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:12,040
and rise to greatness!

336
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:28,800
Staff Officer Liang.

337
00:17:30,840 --> 00:17:31,360
Well, well.

338
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:33,200
Battalion Commander Guo only has eyes for Staff Officer Liang.

339
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:36,040
No need to explain. I understand.

340
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:37,240
You two talk. I'll leave you to it.

341
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:38,880
Don't mind her.

342
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:40,240
Staff Officer Liang,

343
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,480
I've done what I promised you.

344
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:44,040
Shouldn't you

345
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:45,520
keep your promise as well?

346
00:17:47,280 --> 00:17:48,040
Three days ago,

347
00:17:48,360 --> 00:17:49,160
the research institute already

348
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,640
agreed to extend the secondment.

349
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:51,440
Because I knew

350
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:53,080
the Wind Rider Battalion commander had to be you.

351
00:17:54,080 --> 00:17:54,800
Then,

352
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:56,040
to a great partnership.

353
00:17:57,360 --> 00:17:58,040
Battalion Commander Guo.

354
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:01,160
To a great partnership.

355
00:18:02,840 --> 00:18:04,840
Zijian, over the past few years,

356
00:18:04,840 --> 00:18:07,840
the Chinese Army has seen frequent successes in its combined arms development,

357
00:18:08,080 --> 00:18:09,160
as we've both witnessed.

358
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:12,000
The pressure on my shoulders is heavy,

359
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:13,880
and the responsibility on yours is just as great.

360
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:17,680
We must stand tall and hold our ground.

361
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:19,280
This is also the example the headquarters

362
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:20,880
is setting for all of our theater command's

363
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:23,920
combined arms battalions.

364
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:25,280
Rest assured, sir.

365
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:28,880
Our First Battalion will definitely set a good example.

366
00:18:30,600 --> 00:18:32,840
A strong start is usually followed by a heavy blow.

367
00:18:32,840 --> 00:18:34,040
Have you ever thought about

368
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:37,160
where this blow against your Wind Rider Battalion

369
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,680
might actually land?

370
00:18:39,280 --> 00:18:40,080
I think

371
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:42,440
we might take hits everywhere.

372
00:18:44,280 --> 00:18:45,320
Stop complaining to me.

373
00:18:46,120 --> 00:18:47,520
Let me tell you some good news.

374
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:49,640
After review by the Group Army Party Committee

375
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:50,920
and approval from the Army,

376
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:52,240
Comrade Xu Lingjun

377
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:54,680
will serve as the commander of the 396th Brigade.

378
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:58,120
The orders will be issued soon.

379
00:18:58,440 --> 00:18:59,400
That's wonderful news!

380
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:01,960
Director Xu's understanding of New Quality Forces

381
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:02,920
is very insightful.

382
00:19:03,040 --> 00:19:04,120
Moving forward, our work

383
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:05,480
will go much more smoothly.

384
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:06,120
Right.

385
00:19:06,320 --> 00:19:07,720
Plus, you two are no strangers.

386
00:19:08,280 --> 00:19:11,360
If you have any issues at work in the future,

387
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:13,400
communicate and interact with him more.

388
00:19:14,760 --> 00:19:15,600
I believe

389
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:17,880
you definitely won't let everyone down.

390
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:19,880
I'll do my best.

391
00:19:48,240 --> 00:19:50,320
You've been sitting here for three hours.

392
00:19:51,120 --> 00:19:52,320
I'm fine.

393
00:19:54,840 --> 00:19:56,560
I just want some peace and quiet.

394
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:03,120
This pen...

395
00:20:03,520 --> 00:20:05,720
is the one Xiaojun's grandpa left you, right?

396
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:15,400
I let him down.

397
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:18,280
Lao Suo,

398
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:21,080
Even if you didn't become brigade commander,

399
00:20:21,120 --> 00:20:22,600
you did your best.

400
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,160
I think

401
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:28,960
Xiaojun's grandpa's spirit

402
00:20:29,840 --> 00:20:31,280
can rest in peace.

403
00:20:35,200 --> 00:20:38,360
I'm probably just exhausted from the training camp lately.

404
00:20:38,720 --> 00:20:39,840
I can't sleep at night.

405
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:43,440
So I just wanted to rest here.

406
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:45,320
I'm alright.

407
00:20:51,400 --> 00:20:52,680
I heard

408
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:54,680
the higher-ups

409
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:57,800
are planning to transfer you to another post.

410
00:21:00,480 --> 00:21:01,240
It's possible.

411
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:10,520
Lao Suo,

412
00:21:13,560 --> 00:21:15,080
Whether you become brigade commander or not

413
00:21:15,520 --> 00:21:16,720
really doesn't matter.

414
00:21:17,040 --> 00:21:17,880
I know.

415
00:21:22,520 --> 00:21:24,360
Didn't Xiaojun's grandpa also say...

416
00:21:25,400 --> 00:21:26,360
Becoming a brigade commander

417
00:21:26,400 --> 00:21:27,720
is just a milestone,

418
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:29,000
not the end goal.

419
00:21:32,480 --> 00:21:33,880
Dad did say that.

420
00:21:35,080 --> 00:21:36,320
I remember it clearly.

421
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:38,960
Don't worry, Ruifang.

422
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:43,000
I know how to handle this.

423
00:21:44,320 --> 00:21:45,320
You don't need to worry.

424
00:21:48,320 --> 00:21:49,400
You have work tomorrow.

425
00:21:49,560 --> 00:21:50,480
Go get some rest.

426
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:54,080
Alright.

427
00:21:55,120 --> 00:21:56,240
You should go to bed early too.

428
00:21:58,120 --> 00:21:58,920
Don't forget to drink some water.

429
00:21:58,920 --> 00:21:59,400
Okay.

430
00:22:02,280 --> 00:22:03,240
I'm going to bed.

431
00:22:33,080 --> 00:22:34,080
Dad.

432
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:37,920
Why are you up so late?

433
00:22:39,520 --> 00:22:40,320
Is something up?

434
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:41,600
Dad,

435
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:43,160
don't be sad.

436
00:22:43,520 --> 00:22:45,760
You'll always be the greatest dad to me.

437
00:22:50,520 --> 00:22:52,120
Even if you didn't become the brigade commander,

438
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:54,480
you will definitely be a brigade commander's dad someday.

439
00:22:55,880 --> 00:22:56,800
I think

440
00:22:58,720 --> 00:23:00,920
I will definitely be a general's dad someday.

441
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:02,480
Definitely.

442
00:23:03,080 --> 00:23:04,640
Good boy. You've got ambition.

443
00:23:05,760 --> 00:23:06,280
Keep it up.

444
00:23:07,480 --> 00:23:08,120
You too.

445
00:23:15,120 --> 00:23:16,280
Looking at these files the past few days,

446
00:23:16,280 --> 00:23:18,000
my eyes are about to go blind.

447
00:23:18,600 --> 00:23:20,920
The top talents from all units and academies

448
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:23,200
are doing whatever it takes to get in here.

449
00:23:23,760 --> 00:23:24,360
Look at this one first.

450
00:23:24,400 --> 00:23:27,040
Master of Big Data Engineering from Army Engineering University.

451
00:23:27,200 --> 00:23:27,800
And this one.

452
00:23:28,160 --> 00:23:30,360
Strategic Support Force Information Engineering University.

453
00:23:30,360 --> 00:23:31,720
Master of Combat Environment Engineering.

454
00:23:32,280 --> 00:23:34,120
They all match perfectly with our Wind Rider Battalion.

455
00:23:37,280 --> 00:23:37,920
And this one.

456
00:23:38,800 --> 00:23:40,000
National University of Defense Technology.

457
00:23:40,760 --> 00:23:42,800
Postgraduate in Information Countermeasure Technology.

458
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:44,080
Anyway, I'm telling you,

459
00:23:44,200 --> 00:23:46,200
this batch is full of extraordinary talents.

460
00:23:46,640 --> 00:23:47,720
Take your time and pick through them.

461
00:23:48,280 --> 00:23:49,880
I thought I was the new wave,

462
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:50,760
but looking at this,

463
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:52,760
even I'll be washed up on the beach.

464
00:23:52,840 --> 00:23:55,120
I've already been washed up on the beach.

465
00:24:00,280 --> 00:24:01,400
Our Wind Rider Battalion

466
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:04,680
is a model battalion established by the Chief's order.

467
00:24:05,560 --> 00:24:07,760
Many people are doing whatever it takes to get in.

468
00:24:08,680 --> 00:24:09,480
You are the battalion commander.

469
00:24:09,960 --> 00:24:11,360
When it comes to personnel organization,

470
00:24:12,840 --> 00:24:14,320
you have the absolute final say.

471
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:15,840
Thank you for your support, Brigade Commander.

472
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:17,920
Let me give you a suggestion.

473
00:24:18,760 --> 00:24:21,040
Don't just look at degrees when selecting newcomers.

474
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:23,120
There are many

475
00:24:24,200 --> 00:24:25,280
who have high degrees,

476
00:24:25,760 --> 00:24:28,320
but they go straight from school to the military.

477
00:24:28,640 --> 00:24:30,760
They haven't experienced real-world challenges,

478
00:24:30,760 --> 00:24:32,400
nor have they been tempered at the grassroots level.

479
00:24:32,920 --> 00:24:34,360
What they think, study, and imagine

480
00:24:34,560 --> 00:24:35,840
is still confined to the academic sphere.

481
00:24:36,880 --> 00:24:38,000
Many people want to join the Wind Rider Battalion

482
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:39,840
because it's easier to achieve results here,

483
00:24:39,960 --> 00:24:42,520
wanting to add weight to their future promotion prospects.

484
00:24:42,800 --> 00:24:43,680
For this type of people,

485
00:24:44,320 --> 00:24:46,200
who just want to use the Wind Rider Battalion as a stepping stone,

486
00:24:46,200 --> 00:24:47,520
we must firmly say no.

487
00:24:47,960 --> 00:24:48,720
Understood.

488
00:24:49,560 --> 00:24:52,080
I'm still more inclined to keep using the old team.

489
00:24:53,160 --> 00:24:55,400
The old team has rich combat experience.

490
00:24:57,640 --> 00:24:58,680
Here is a piece of advice.

491
00:24:59,960 --> 00:25:00,840
For certain individuals,

492
00:25:01,440 --> 00:25:04,680
comrades with a weak grasp of individual techniques and tactics,

493
00:25:04,920 --> 00:25:06,200
you can't just be blindly accommodating.

494
00:25:06,840 --> 00:25:08,160
After all, our Wind Rider Battalion

495
00:25:08,200 --> 00:25:10,560
is the future direction of reform for the entire group army.

496
00:25:11,440 --> 00:25:12,360
Those who are unqualified

497
00:25:13,120 --> 00:25:14,000
must be firmly dismissed.

498
00:25:14,400 --> 00:25:15,440
I trust you

499
00:25:16,000 --> 00:25:17,560
will be objective and fair.

500
00:25:17,920 --> 00:25:18,920
I guarantee to complete the mission.

501
00:25:27,360 --> 00:25:28,760
Captain, stop staring.

502
00:25:28,760 --> 00:25:29,640
Come play for a bit.

503
00:25:29,760 --> 00:25:31,200
What's up with you, kid?

504
00:25:31,840 --> 00:25:33,480
You're not studying the new equipment.

505
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:34,680
Can you figure it out?

506
00:25:35,120 --> 00:25:36,160
Does it even need studying?

507
00:25:36,160 --> 00:25:37,320
A little hands-on, and I'll get it.

508
00:25:37,360 --> 00:25:38,920
I'll teach you later. Come on.

509
00:25:39,720 --> 00:25:40,520
Just play your ball.

510
00:25:40,800 --> 00:25:41,640
Don't bother me.

511
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:45,080
I heard

512
00:25:45,200 --> 00:25:47,400
the battalion commander is cutting a few companies in a few days.

513
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:48,400
We won't be among them, right?

514
00:25:50,240 --> 00:25:51,640
It's not a complete cut.

515
00:25:52,680 --> 00:25:54,520
But downsizing personnel is a must.

516
00:25:55,640 --> 00:25:57,120
It's called... called...

517
00:25:59,160 --> 00:25:59,920
Weed out the old, bring in the new.

518
00:26:00,160 --> 00:26:03,000
I heard countless experts from all over are applying.

519
00:26:03,040 --> 00:26:03,760
Just the resumes alone

520
00:26:03,760 --> 00:26:05,440
have already filled up our battalion commander's office.

521
00:26:06,120 --> 00:26:07,560
Every spot is strictly accounted for.

522
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:08,800
Tell me,

523
00:26:09,040 --> 00:26:10,000
will it affect us?

524
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:11,160
Getting into the Wind Rider Battalion

525
00:26:11,160 --> 00:26:12,480
is like getting into a top high school.

526
00:26:12,880 --> 00:26:14,280
You've got one foot in Tsinghua or Peking University.

527
00:26:14,280 --> 00:26:15,080
Who wouldn't want to go?

528
00:26:16,320 --> 00:26:17,920
I definitely couldn't get into Tsinghua or Peking.

529
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:19,720
Captain, you're being modest.

530
00:26:19,880 --> 00:26:21,000
Do you even need to take the exam?

531
00:26:21,080 --> 00:26:21,680
Guaranteed admission.

532
00:26:21,880 --> 00:26:22,440
Exactly.

533
00:26:22,440 --> 00:26:22,920
That's right.

534
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:23,360
Guaranteed admission for the Captain!

535
00:26:23,360 --> 00:26:24,160
Come play with us for a bit.

536
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:24,680
Exactly, Captain.

537
00:26:24,680 --> 00:26:25,400
Come on, Captain.

538
00:26:25,400 --> 00:26:26,040
Come on, Captain.

539
00:26:26,040 --> 00:26:26,520
Come on.

540
00:26:28,920 --> 00:26:30,800
Regarding the personnel roster,

541
00:26:31,960 --> 00:26:32,960
overall,

542
00:26:33,200 --> 00:26:34,160
I don't have any major objections.

543
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:36,120
I just want to point out one thing.

544
00:26:36,760 --> 00:26:37,720
Please go ahead, sir.

545
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:42,240
You want to stick with the First Battalion's old team.

546
00:26:42,920 --> 00:26:44,240
I can understand that.

547
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:45,480
After all, everyone has been together

548
00:26:45,560 --> 00:26:47,440
and working as a team for so long.

549
00:26:48,280 --> 00:26:49,000
But...

550
00:26:51,520 --> 00:26:52,760
The Wind Rider Battalion isn't the 1st Battalion.

551
00:26:54,080 --> 00:26:55,480
We need to bring in the new

552
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:57,000
and weed out the old.

553
00:26:57,520 --> 00:26:58,200
Understood?

554
00:26:59,560 --> 00:27:00,520
For those who are

555
00:27:00,880 --> 00:27:01,880
on the older side,

556
00:27:02,720 --> 00:27:03,560
less educated,

557
00:27:04,600 --> 00:27:05,440
and limited in capability,

558
00:27:06,240 --> 00:27:07,840
we still have to eliminate them.

559
00:27:09,680 --> 00:27:11,040
I'm sorry, Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

560
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:14,400
I didn't quite catch who you're referring to.

561
00:27:15,800 --> 00:27:18,120
I'm not targeting anyone in particular.

562
00:27:18,120 --> 00:27:19,720
I'm just talking about this phenomenon.

563
00:27:21,920 --> 00:27:23,160
I hope that in the future,

564
00:27:23,480 --> 00:27:25,000
the men in our Wind Rider Battalion,

565
00:27:25,440 --> 00:27:26,240
all the officers and soldiers,

566
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:29,040
will rely on their personal abilities

567
00:27:29,680 --> 00:27:30,680
rather than their seniority.

568
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:32,200
The Wind Rider Battalion

569
00:27:32,560 --> 00:27:33,880
cannot harbor barracks rats anymore.

570
00:27:36,120 --> 00:27:37,760
The more I hear, the more confused I get.

571
00:27:38,680 --> 00:27:39,880
Let alone the Wind Rider Battalion,

572
00:27:40,280 --> 00:27:41,760
even in the former 1st Battalion,

573
00:27:42,080 --> 00:27:43,040
there were no barracks rats.

574
00:27:44,160 --> 00:27:44,960
What do you mean there weren't?

575
00:27:46,960 --> 00:27:48,360
Li Songwei

576
00:27:49,440 --> 00:27:51,520
fought with another company commander before.

577
00:27:51,920 --> 00:27:53,200
He has a terrible track record.

578
00:27:53,920 --> 00:27:54,840
And right now,

579
00:27:55,360 --> 00:27:57,080
some probationary platoon leaders under him

580
00:27:57,360 --> 00:27:58,840
even hold master's degrees.

581
00:27:59,320 --> 00:27:59,920
Tell me,

582
00:28:00,880 --> 00:28:02,000
tell me, can he command their respect?

583
00:28:04,360 --> 00:28:05,240
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

584
00:28:05,800 --> 00:28:07,200
I assure you,

585
00:28:07,520 --> 00:28:09,520
Li Songwei is absolutely not a barracks rat.

586
00:28:10,120 --> 00:28:12,600
Besides, wasn't that fighting incident already cleared up?

587
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:15,320
As the 1st Company is the 1st Battalion's dagger company,

588
00:28:15,840 --> 00:28:18,360
Li Songwei's contributions as its commander are undeniable.

589
00:28:18,800 --> 00:28:20,480
Furthermore, he has been working very hard

590
00:28:20,480 --> 00:28:21,360
to improve himself.

591
00:28:21,360 --> 00:28:23,000
I didn't say he isn't working hard.

592
00:28:23,800 --> 00:28:25,160
But to enter the Wind Rider Battalion,

593
00:28:25,160 --> 00:28:26,520
hard work is not enough.

594
00:28:28,800 --> 00:28:29,880
Li Songwei's limits...

595
00:28:30,480 --> 00:28:31,440
I can imagine them.

596
00:28:31,440 --> 00:28:32,720
I can see them.

597
00:28:33,920 --> 00:28:36,200
Being a company commander in the old 1st Battalion was fine.

598
00:28:36,360 --> 00:28:37,200
He was qualified

599
00:28:37,960 --> 00:28:38,920
and competent.

600
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:40,720
But right now,

601
00:28:40,840 --> 00:28:42,920
the 1st Battalion has become the Wind Rider Battalion.

602
00:28:43,120 --> 00:28:44,040
So shouldn't the 1st Company

603
00:28:44,280 --> 00:28:46,480
be upgraded and transformed accordingly?

604
00:28:47,440 --> 00:28:49,360
Under these new standards,

605
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:52,040
he falls short.

606
00:28:52,240 --> 00:28:53,720
His capabilities are no longer enough.

607
00:28:54,560 --> 00:28:55,800
Of course, let me reiterate,

608
00:28:56,360 --> 00:28:57,600
I'm not targeting

609
00:28:57,960 --> 00:28:59,000
Li Songwei personally.

610
00:28:59,400 --> 00:29:00,280
I'm just talking about

611
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:02,160
this matter, this phenomenon.

612
00:29:06,840 --> 00:29:07,400
Understood.

613
00:29:07,760 --> 00:29:08,800
You make a fair point.

614
00:29:09,480 --> 00:29:12,120
For comrades with weak theoretical foundations,

615
00:29:12,480 --> 00:29:14,600
we'll have corresponding training courses later

616
00:29:14,760 --> 00:29:16,200
to help them improve as quickly as possible.

617
00:29:16,320 --> 00:29:17,280
How does that sound?

618
00:29:17,520 --> 00:29:19,640
Are you treating my Wind Rider Battalion like a training class?

619
00:29:20,400 --> 00:29:21,560
Comrade Guo Zijian,

620
00:29:21,920 --> 00:29:22,400
let me ask you,

621
00:29:23,160 --> 00:29:25,560
who can guarantee a war won't break out tomorrow?

622
00:29:27,920 --> 00:29:30,560
Would last-minute training right before battle

623
00:29:30,800 --> 00:29:31,560
be in time?

624
00:29:32,960 --> 00:29:34,160
This situation just shows

625
00:29:34,280 --> 00:29:36,000
he is not qualified to join the Wind Rider Battalion.

626
00:29:37,160 --> 00:29:38,040
Let me also tell you,

627
00:29:38,560 --> 00:29:39,560
not just for the Wind Rider Battalion,

628
00:29:40,160 --> 00:29:42,320
I'll have the exact same requirements for the Hurricane Battalion.

629
00:29:45,520 --> 00:29:46,720
I know

630
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:50,040
you two are close privately

631
00:29:50,360 --> 00:29:51,760
and have a tight relationship.

632
00:29:53,040 --> 00:29:54,360
But when it comes to force building,

633
00:29:55,640 --> 00:29:57,000
you can't let personal feelings get in the way.

634
00:29:59,920 --> 00:30:01,240
I'm not letting personal feelings get in the way.

635
00:30:02,240 --> 00:30:03,640
I also hope, Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

636
00:30:03,920 --> 00:30:05,800
that you don't let your personal bias

637
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:07,080
cloud your judgment.

638
00:30:07,200 --> 00:30:08,400
What personal bias?

639
00:30:09,520 --> 00:30:10,760
Who am I biased against?

640
00:30:12,920 --> 00:30:14,760
I'm just being responsible for the Wind Rider Battalion.

641
00:30:16,040 --> 00:30:17,040
I'm sorry, Sir.

642
00:30:17,240 --> 00:30:18,200
I misspoke.

643
00:30:18,360 --> 00:30:19,200
I apologize.

644
00:30:20,760 --> 00:30:21,800
Since the Wind Rider Battalion

645
00:30:22,280 --> 00:30:24,160
entrusted me with the power to select personnel,

646
00:30:24,800 --> 00:30:25,840
I hope the commanders

647
00:30:26,040 --> 00:30:27,640
can seriously consider my opinion

648
00:30:28,000 --> 00:30:29,160
and trust my judgment.

649
00:30:40,320 --> 00:30:41,840
Seriously, why do you always ruin a compliment?

650
00:30:42,040 --> 00:30:43,080
I just praised you a few days ago,

651
00:30:43,120 --> 00:30:44,360
saying you've become steady and mature,

652
00:30:44,520 --> 00:30:46,000
and learned to control your emotions.

653
00:30:46,080 --> 00:30:47,440
What kind of stunt are you pulling today?

654
00:30:47,800 --> 00:30:49,360
Did I want to argue with him?

655
00:30:50,320 --> 00:30:52,400
He actually called Li Songwei a barracks rat!

656
00:30:52,480 --> 00:30:54,000
Back then, Li Songwei got into a fight

657
00:30:54,000 --> 00:30:55,760
because I transferred him to be the battalion staff officer,

658
00:30:55,760 --> 00:30:56,880
responsible for supervising everyone.

659
00:30:56,960 --> 00:30:58,960
Isn't it just because we didn't penalize someone like he wanted?

660
00:30:58,960 --> 00:31:00,520
And he still holds a grudge about it.

661
00:31:00,520 --> 00:31:02,240
There's a problem with what you're saying.

662
00:31:02,560 --> 00:31:03,360
It's not objective.

663
00:31:03,360 --> 00:31:04,760
How am I not objective?

664
00:31:04,760 --> 00:31:05,640
I admit,

665
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:08,600
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo's words were indeed a bit harsh.

666
00:31:09,120 --> 00:31:10,440
But do you really think what he said

667
00:31:10,440 --> 00:31:11,880
makes no sense at all?

668
00:31:15,080 --> 00:31:15,680
Guo Zijian,

669
00:31:17,840 --> 00:31:19,040
Li Songwei and I

670
00:31:19,400 --> 00:31:20,680
have known each other for over ten years.

671
00:31:21,560 --> 00:31:23,560
I've known him longer than you have,

672
00:31:24,080 --> 00:31:25,480
and our bond is deeper than yours.

673
00:31:26,560 --> 00:31:29,040
So I feel I have the right today

674
00:31:29,560 --> 00:31:30,600
to speak the fair truth.

675
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:34,400
There are only a few company commander roles in the Wind Rider Battalion.

676
00:31:34,400 --> 00:31:35,760
You could say they're one in ten thousand.

677
00:31:35,760 --> 00:31:36,760
That's not an exaggeration at all.

678
00:31:38,040 --> 00:31:39,040
Do you really think Li Songwei

679
00:31:39,040 --> 00:31:40,160
among our current candidates

680
00:31:40,160 --> 00:31:41,520
is the most outstanding one?

681
00:31:47,280 --> 00:31:48,440
I'm not going to discuss this with you.

682
00:31:49,440 --> 00:31:50,440
Just think about it.

683
00:31:51,120 --> 00:31:53,440
Think about how much Li Songwei sacrificed for the First Battalion.

684
00:31:54,640 --> 00:31:55,760
Whenever the First Battalion had difficulties,

685
00:31:55,760 --> 00:31:56,880
he was always the first to step up.

686
00:31:57,000 --> 00:31:58,360
Including this training camp,

687
00:31:58,760 --> 00:32:00,560
transferring him to the support team to be my assistant,

688
00:32:00,560 --> 00:32:01,520
he didn't complain at all.

689
00:32:02,200 --> 00:32:03,960
Now that the Wind Rider Battalion is established,

690
00:32:04,360 --> 00:32:05,600
you want me to kick him out?

691
00:32:05,960 --> 00:32:07,240
Would I even be human?

692
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:09,400
What do you expect Li Songwei to think?

693
00:32:09,560 --> 00:32:10,800
How will the officers and soldiers view this?

694
00:32:10,800 --> 00:32:12,360
Tell me, what should I do?

695
00:32:17,840 --> 00:32:18,400
I know

696
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:20,920
you value relationships,

697
00:32:22,120 --> 00:32:23,000
and you value loyalty.

698
00:32:25,160 --> 00:32:26,360
But I also want to ask you,

699
00:32:27,720 --> 00:32:28,280
Guo Zijian,

700
00:32:29,880 --> 00:32:30,920
if one day,

701
00:32:31,960 --> 00:32:33,240
we go to the battlefield,

702
00:32:34,680 --> 00:32:35,920
will our enemies

703
00:32:36,760 --> 00:32:38,880
care about our relationships and loyalty?

704
00:32:43,280 --> 00:32:44,640
I don't want to talk about this.

705
00:32:45,880 --> 00:32:46,760
Saying too much

706
00:32:48,920 --> 00:32:50,440
just makes me feel bad too.

707
00:32:51,360 --> 00:32:52,200
The Wind Rider Battalion

708
00:32:53,480 --> 00:32:55,040
is the group army's

709
00:32:56,480 --> 00:32:57,920
pilot unit for reform.

710
00:32:59,760 --> 00:33:00,680
Reform means

711
00:33:00,680 --> 00:33:01,720
pushing out the old to bring in the new,

712
00:33:02,200 --> 00:33:03,120
and survival of the fittest.

713
00:33:04,520 --> 00:33:05,400
We are soldiers.

714
00:33:06,320 --> 00:33:07,560
The word "soldier"

715
00:33:10,120 --> 00:33:11,520
means sacrifice.

716
00:33:13,680 --> 00:33:15,360
All different kinds of sacrifices.

717
00:33:16,760 --> 00:33:17,720
In my heart,

718
00:33:17,880 --> 00:33:19,560
I think they are all the most glorious.

719
00:33:23,760 --> 00:33:25,080
I also want to ask you a serious question.

720
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:27,440
If one day,

721
00:33:28,360 --> 00:33:29,440
there is truly someone

722
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:31,600
who is better suited than you, Guo Zijian,

723
00:33:32,440 --> 00:33:34,560
for the role of Wind Rider Battalion Commander,

724
00:33:37,960 --> 00:33:38,840
what will you do?

725
00:34:31,320 --> 00:34:33,120
Li Songwei, have you lost your mind?

726
00:34:33,600 --> 00:34:34,840
Quitting the Wind Rider Battalion?

727
00:34:35,120 --> 00:34:36,600
What's gotten into you now?

728
00:34:37,760 --> 00:34:38,400
Battalion Commander.

729
00:34:38,600 --> 00:34:39,400
At my age,

730
00:34:39,400 --> 00:34:40,880
if I can't even be a commanding officer,

731
00:34:40,920 --> 00:34:42,400
what's the point of doing this?

732
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:44,560
But if I really have to compete for it,

733
00:34:44,760 --> 00:34:45,480
to be honest,

734
00:34:45,800 --> 00:34:46,800
I don't have it in me anymore.

735
00:34:47,040 --> 00:34:47,600
A few days ago,

736
00:34:47,600 --> 00:34:48,760
when you, Commander Jiang, and the rest

737
00:34:48,760 --> 00:34:49,840
were running those drills,

738
00:34:50,000 --> 00:34:51,200
I couldn't even pitch in.

739
00:34:51,320 --> 00:34:52,040
Let alone pitching in,

740
00:34:52,040 --> 00:34:53,200
sometimes just watching them

741
00:34:53,200 --> 00:34:54,000
was a struggle.

742
00:34:54,200 --> 00:34:54,920
That's fine.

743
00:34:55,600 --> 00:34:57,400
If you don't understand, ask and learn.

744
00:34:57,600 --> 00:34:58,480
Is it really that hard to learn?

745
00:34:58,480 --> 00:34:59,520
I'll give you time.

746
00:34:59,520 --> 00:35:01,600
I've been hearing things lately.

747
00:35:01,600 --> 00:35:03,960
So many people are dying to get in.

748
00:35:04,280 --> 00:35:05,800
Every single one of them is highly educated.

749
00:35:05,800 --> 00:35:07,320
And they speak foreign languages fluently.

750
00:35:08,480 --> 00:35:10,400
Diplomas are just one part of it.

751
00:35:10,400 --> 00:35:11,880
We can't judge solely on that.

752
00:35:11,960 --> 00:35:13,520
But Commander, don't forget.

753
00:35:13,680 --> 00:35:14,880
What you're building now is

754
00:35:14,880 --> 00:35:17,200
the army's first New Quality Combat Battalion.

755
00:35:17,520 --> 00:35:19,280
The standards are different from before.

756
00:35:19,280 --> 00:35:20,720
You don't need to tell me this.

757
00:35:21,440 --> 00:35:23,440
Even fingers on a hand have different lengths.

758
00:35:23,560 --> 00:35:24,520
People are the same way.

759
00:35:25,360 --> 00:35:26,520
You might not have a high degree,

760
00:35:26,600 --> 00:35:28,160
but with over ten years of experience,

761
00:35:28,160 --> 00:35:29,640
can a diploma really compare?

762
00:35:29,680 --> 00:35:31,520
But those soldiers don't just have degrees.

763
00:35:31,520 --> 00:35:32,920
They have just as much experience as I do.

764
00:35:33,280 --> 00:35:35,000
Those are the soldiers you need.

765
00:35:35,320 --> 00:35:36,400
If because of me,

766
00:35:36,600 --> 00:35:38,280
the quality of this battalion drops,

767
00:35:38,400 --> 00:35:40,480
you couldn't accept it, and neither could I.

768
00:35:40,960 --> 00:35:42,440
I refuse to be a useless soldier.

769
00:35:42,600 --> 00:35:44,880
But the 1st Battalion is now the Wind Rider Battalion.

770
00:35:45,440 --> 00:35:46,320
Where can you step down to?

771
00:35:46,840 --> 00:35:48,000
Don't tell me you want a civilian transfer.

772
00:36:08,440 --> 00:36:09,680
Li Songwei, are you crazy?

773
00:36:09,800 --> 00:36:11,040
Have you lost your mind?

774
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:14,720
I disagree.

775
00:36:14,840 --> 00:36:15,960
I absolutely disagree.

776
00:36:15,960 --> 00:36:16,560
Battalion Commander.

777
00:36:16,560 --> 00:36:17,200
That's enough.

778
00:36:17,640 --> 00:36:18,800
Not another word. Get out.

779
00:36:28,480 --> 00:36:29,000
Fine.

780
00:36:30,040 --> 00:36:31,000
You're not leaving?

781
00:36:31,880 --> 00:36:32,400
I'll leave.

782
00:36:34,160 --> 00:36:35,280
I disagree.

783
00:36:52,920 --> 00:36:53,480
Battalion Commander.

784
00:36:54,440 --> 00:36:55,520
The instructor has allocated

785
00:36:55,520 --> 00:36:57,200
specific barracks for the female soldiers.

786
00:36:57,400 --> 00:36:58,520
I went to take a look just now.

787
00:36:58,720 --> 00:36:59,840
Everything is well-arranged.

788
00:37:05,840 --> 00:37:08,440
Also, the founding ceremony for the Wind Rider Battalion

789
00:37:08,520 --> 00:37:10,040
is pretty much all set too.

790
00:37:13,400 --> 00:37:15,520
Do you think I'm a qualified battalion commander?

791
00:37:19,360 --> 00:37:20,360
Yes.

792
00:37:24,760 --> 00:37:25,840
I don't think I am.

793
00:37:35,200 --> 00:37:36,720
Why are you doubting yourself?

794
00:37:38,080 --> 00:37:38,880
You possess

795
00:37:39,520 --> 00:37:40,960
all the essential qualities

796
00:37:40,960 --> 00:37:42,160
of an excellent commander.

797
00:37:42,360 --> 00:37:43,400
And these qualities have been

798
00:37:43,400 --> 00:37:44,880
tested by our superiors.

799
00:37:49,440 --> 00:37:50,400
Is it because of Li Songwei?

800
00:37:55,880 --> 00:37:57,280
I know Li Songwei

801
00:37:58,640 --> 00:38:00,920
isn't the best fit for 1st Battalion's infantry commander.

802
00:38:02,760 --> 00:38:03,960
But letting him go,

803
00:38:05,080 --> 00:38:05,760
I just can't do it.

804
00:38:14,840 --> 00:38:15,880
As for this matter,

805
00:38:17,520 --> 00:38:18,320
I also

806
00:38:18,880 --> 00:38:20,760
don't have much advice for you.

807
00:38:23,320 --> 00:38:25,120
Because making such choices is always hard.

808
00:38:28,760 --> 00:38:30,240
But I can be sure of one thing.

809
00:38:31,520 --> 00:38:33,240
Whatever decision you make,

810
00:38:35,120 --> 00:38:36,520
everyone will believe in you

811
00:38:37,400 --> 00:38:38,040
and support you.

812
00:38:40,600 --> 00:38:41,440
And so will I.

813
00:38:57,400 --> 00:38:58,320
I'll get going then.

814
00:39:55,000 --> 00:39:55,800
Battalion Commander,

815
00:39:56,520 --> 00:39:57,720
how much you've looked out for me,

816
00:39:58,600 --> 00:39:59,520
I understand it all.

817
00:40:00,640 --> 00:40:03,720
But I can't be the one holding everyone back.

818
00:40:04,720 --> 00:40:06,760
You've never held anyone back.

819
00:40:08,680 --> 00:40:10,040
That's all I need to hear.

820
00:40:11,640 --> 00:40:12,760
I'm not a kid,

821
00:40:14,160 --> 00:40:15,200
and I'm not acting out of spite.

822
00:40:16,120 --> 00:40:18,600
This is a well-thought-out decision.

823
00:40:23,600 --> 00:40:25,280
Even if you don't join the Wind Rider Battalion,

824
00:40:27,120 --> 00:40:28,280
we can still figure something out

825
00:40:28,280 --> 00:40:30,040
to transfer you to another unit.

826
00:40:30,600 --> 00:40:33,000
Didn't you want to be a staff officer at headquarters?

827
00:40:33,120 --> 00:40:34,800
I can talk to the Brigade Commander.

828
00:40:35,120 --> 00:40:36,360
There's no need to insist on a civilian transfer.

829
00:40:37,520 --> 00:40:39,440
You said it yourself, that was before.

830
00:40:41,120 --> 00:40:42,000
Honestly,

831
00:40:42,720 --> 00:40:45,080
what I used to think about most was

832
00:40:45,520 --> 00:40:46,880
how to get promoted,

833
00:40:47,160 --> 00:40:48,360
and how to quickly

834
00:40:48,360 --> 00:40:49,840
bring my wife and kids over here.

835
00:40:50,720 --> 00:40:52,120
But I don't think like that anymore.

836
00:40:52,960 --> 00:40:54,080
I've thought it through.

837
00:40:54,840 --> 00:40:57,240
Rather than coasting along in the army,

838
00:40:57,480 --> 00:40:58,960
it's better to go home early.

839
00:40:59,480 --> 00:41:00,920
While I'm still not too old,

840
00:41:01,120 --> 00:41:02,160
I can still start over.

841
00:41:02,720 --> 00:41:03,800
If I wait another two years,

842
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:04,960
I'll be too old,

843
00:41:05,000 --> 00:41:06,280
and I'll miss out on everything.

844
00:41:11,560 --> 00:41:12,960
But can you really bear

845
00:41:13,720 --> 00:41:15,240
to take off this uniform?

846
00:41:19,560 --> 00:41:20,600
I really can't.

847
00:41:21,560 --> 00:41:22,960
But it's about time.

848
00:41:24,160 --> 00:41:25,960
I can't be a stumbling block for the military reform.

849
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:28,840
Battalion Commander,

850
00:41:29,160 --> 00:41:30,960
just submit the report.

851
00:41:40,640 --> 00:41:41,240
Battalion Commander,

852
00:41:41,520 --> 00:41:43,520
dawdling isn't your style.

853
00:41:43,640 --> 00:41:45,240
And I, Li Songwei, am no dawdler either.

854
00:41:45,400 --> 00:41:46,760
I never drag my feet when doing things.

855
00:41:47,680 --> 00:41:48,920
Look at it this way,

856
00:41:49,280 --> 00:41:50,280
it's almost time for

857
00:41:50,280 --> 00:41:51,920
the civilian transfer approval period.

858
00:41:52,360 --> 00:41:53,880
Once this report is approved,

859
00:41:53,880 --> 00:41:55,280
I can take the exams as soon as I get home.

860
00:41:55,320 --> 00:41:55,840
Right?

861
00:41:57,320 --> 00:41:58,080
Don't worry,

862
00:41:58,520 --> 00:41:59,960
even if I return to civilian life,

863
00:42:00,360 --> 00:42:01,960
I can still make something of myself.

864
00:42:02,120 --> 00:42:03,520
I'll never embarrass us soldiers.

865
00:42:04,400 --> 00:42:05,200
Like I always say,

866
00:42:05,600 --> 00:42:06,480
absolutely!

867
00:42:18,760 --> 00:42:19,320
All right.

868
00:42:20,600 --> 00:42:21,560
I agree to it.

869
00:42:24,120 --> 00:42:25,160
But I have one condition.

870
00:42:25,600 --> 00:42:26,160
Name it.

871
00:42:28,320 --> 00:42:29,480
For establishing the Wind Rider Battalion...

872
00:42:30,560 --> 00:42:31,720
...you deserve some of the credit.

873
00:42:32,920 --> 00:42:35,640
You must attend the founding of the Wind Rider Battalion...

874
00:42:36,960 --> 00:42:37,920
...before you can leave.

875
00:42:43,640 --> 00:42:44,560
Battalion Commander.

876
00:42:46,360 --> 00:42:47,080
Thank you.
